[libzstd] Rename ZSTD_CCtxParam_* to ZSTD_CCtxParams_*

* Renames functions to `ZSTD_CCtxParams_*`.
* The CI will test that everything still builds, and that I didn't miss a call-site.
* I've left the `ZSTDMT_` functions alone, since they are only here for compatibility, so it would be silly to rename them. Side question, when do we want to deprecate/delete these?

Fixes #1529.

