support decompressing an empty frame into NULL

fix #1385 : 
decompressing into `NULL` is an automatic error in `v1.3.7`.
This patch now allows it, as long as the content of the frame is empty.

This behavior seems to simplify things a bit for `arrow`.
Not sure if any other project may rely on this behavior...

