AutoFetch new branch created with gh issue develop

# Summary

Fixes #7588

This PR proposes an enhancement to the gh issue develop command, ensuring that even if a branch is created without the checkout option, it is still fetched and accessible on the local Git system.

# Rationale
The existing version of the `gh issue develop` command doesn't fetch newly created branches on the local system unless the checkout option is specified. This might be confusing or inconvenient for users who expect to see their new branch locally but have not chosen the checkout option. This enhancement thus improves the usability and user experience of the GitHub CLI tool.

