Adding set secrets from env files

Fixes #3579
Allows to set multiple secrets using a simple `.env` file.
```bash
gh secret set -f secrets.env
```
The `.env` file follows a simple format as defined in [godotenv](https://github.com/joho/godotenv)

```
SPAM="eggs"
FOO="bar"
```

