- `tracing_core::Subscriber` to `tracing_core::Collect`
- `tracing_subscriber::layer::Layer` to `tracing_subscriber::layer::Subscribe`
- _Most_ types that implement `tracing_core::Subscriber` have been renamed to the `Collector`-based naming scheme
- _Most_ types that implement `tracing_subscriber::Layer` have been renamed to the `Subscriber`-based naming scheme

Resolves #641.

