There is a logic in `createCssVarsProvider` that will [delete some fields](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/blob/master/packages/mui-system/src/cssVars/createCssVarsProvider.js#L189) from the `css` object to not be included in the `:root`. Since the `css` is not always a new object, all of the `--mui-overlays-*` are removed in the first render and never exist after that.

## Fix

just need to ensure that the `css` is always a new object. 

✅ Test added.

