[base] Disable classes generation via a context

As agreed in https://github.com/mui/material-ui/pull/34380#issuecomment-1311849864, this PR adds the possibility to disable built-in classes in MUI Base.

It can be done by wrapping components in a `ClassNameConfigurator`:

```tsx
<ClassNameConfigurator disableDefaultClasses>
  <ButtonUnstyled>Button</ButtonUnstyled>
</ClassNameConfigurator>
```

The feature is applied to all Base components and has been added to the conformance test suite.

Closes #30820


