[FormControlLabel] Add `required` prop

Resolves #34198.
- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).



Adds 'required' state support for `FormControlLabel`. Changes mostly copied from `FormLabel`.

- Propagates the `required` prop from and to the `control` component, like we do for `disabled`.
- Doesn't inherit `required` from `FormControl`, since it breaks usages such as a required checkbox group: https://mui.com/material-ui/react-checkbox/#formgroup


