+- Rename `pendingPosition` prop to `loadingPosition`.
+
+  ```diff
+  -<LoadingButton pending pendingIndicator="Pending..." pendingPosition="end" />
+  +<LoadingButton loading loadingIndicator="Pending..." loadingPosition="end" />
